~ intro
Garbage Collector: THE MEMORY LEAKS!! IT LEAKS AND LEAKS AND-
Garbage Collector: All that unrefrenced data... lost.
Garbage Collector: I'll never be able to collect it all...
if GameStats.garbage_data > 0
	=> shop_unlock
else 
	Integer: You okay?
	Garbage Collector: If you find any Garbage Data please bring it to me!
	Garbage Collector: Those poor bytes left full of information that means nothing...
	=> END

~ shop_unlock
Garbage Collector: Wait... do you have some Garbage Data on you?
Integer: Yes, I found it on my journey thorugh the program.
Garbage Collector: Give it to me!!
=> open_shop


~ open_shop
NPCManager.open_shop.emit()
=> END